00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:19.000
But it's not over for Bruce. The producer says, Hey, stick around. We might have another thing for you. That thing turned out to be the ABC series, The Green Hornet, where Bruce plays Cato, the sidekick to the crime-fighting Green Hornet.
