00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:56.000
Bruce comes in, he gets the part, and he goes and tries to get some acting training, and he and his acting coach are looking at these scripts, and he's like, wait a minute, they didn't give me any lines, because nobody has ever imagined that Cato would ever speak. And for the vast majority of the show, Bruce was indeed silent. He's a guy who saves the Green Hornet's ass because the Green Hornet can't fight for himself. He's an executive. He sits on the back seat and he kind of tells him, Cato Drive or Cato cook or Cato like Kung Fu that guy.
李小龙进组拿下了这个角色，然后他去试图接受一些表演训练，他和他的表演教练看着这些剧本，心想，等等，他们没有给我安排任何台词，因为从来没有人想过加藤会开口说话。在绝大多数剧集中，李小龙确实都是沉默寡言的。他是一个拯救青蜂侠于水火之中的人，因为青蜂侠自己不会打架。他是个高管。他坐在后座上，指挥着，加藤开车，或者加藤做饭，或者加藤对那家伙用功夫。

30
00:13:56.000 --> 00:14:19.000
And that's what Cato does. This kind of subordination, servility. This is something that Cato had inherited from earlier versions of this character. At first on the radio. An adventure of the Green Hornet. Which is an old sort of character that's kind of blandly oriental. They've never really figured out who this guy is. Originally, the writers made him Japanese.
这就是加藤所做的事。这种顺从、奴性。这是加藤从这个角色的早期版本中继承下来的东西。最初是在广播里。《青蜂侠历险记》。这是一个老旧的、带点温吞东方色彩的角色。他们从没真正弄清楚这家伙到底是谁。最初，编剧把他设定为日本人。

