00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:42.000
But then, in the lead-up to World War II, that seemed unsavory. So suddenly, Cato wasn't Japanese anymore. He was just... Cato, his faithful valet. Then the writers gave him a new identity. Cato was now... His Filipino valet Cato stepped through a secret panel in Britain. Then, in the film serials, executives made him Korean,
但在二战前夕，这看起来很不讨喜。于是突然之间，加藤不再是日本人了。他只是……加藤，他忠诚的贴身男仆。然后编剧赋予了他一个新的身份。加藤现在是……他的菲律宾贴身男仆加藤穿过了英国的一个秘密暗门。然后，在系列电影中，高管们把他变成了韩国人。

