00:19:46.000 --> 00:20:24.000
What's interesting is that it's already building in the culture, right? So if you look at what Bruce is doing with his friends, in terms of mixing up these different types of martial arts forms from Asia and the Pacific is heralding this new development of an Asian America. After years of frustration, the culture seemed to be changing. And it seemed to Bruce that now, just maybe, he might be able to break out of his role as the sidekick. In 1970, Bruce met with Fred Weintraub, a Warner Brothers executive who wanted him to star in a new film project, literally called Kung Fu.
有趣的是，这种文化已经在酝酿之中了，对吧？所以如果你看看李小龙和他的朋友们在做的事，他们将来自亚洲和太平洋地区的各种武术流派融合在一起，这正预示着亚裔美国人这一新身份的发展。经过多年的挫折，文化似乎正在发生变化。李小龙觉得，现在也许，仅仅是也许，他终于能够摆脱自己作为配角的命运了。1970年，李小龙与华纳兄弟的高管弗雷德·韦因特劳布（Fred Weintraub）会面，后者希望他主演一个全新的电影项目，片名直译就叫《功夫》。

