Bruce, more than anybody else in the country, has popularized this martial art called Kung Fu. And he's been on TV. So all the other Asian American actors in Hollywood are like, oh, that's a lead part, but that's Bruce's part. I'm not even going to go out for that part. Bruce nails the audition. But still, the other executives in the studio are dragging their feet. They ultimately kill the idea of a Kung Fu movie. They do keep dangling the possibility of a TV series, but frustrated and worried.
李小龙比美国任何人都更普及了这种名为“功夫”的武术。而且他上过电视。所以好莱坞所有其他的亚裔美国演员都觉得：哦，那是个主角，但那是李小龙的角色。我甚至都不会去竞争那个角色。李小龙的试镜表现惊艳全场。但即便如此，片厂的其他高管还是畏缩不前。他们最终取消了制作《功夫》电影的想法。他们确实一直在吊着观众的胃口，暗示可能会推出电视剧，但这让李小龙感到沮丧和担忧。

44
00:20:54.000 --> 00:21:12.000
Without an answer, Ruth decides to take a job in Hong Kong. Like Hong Kong's Kung Fu film industry at that particular time is running all of Asia. And they're like clamoring. We want that guy. We need to get that guy. He's already made it in Hollywood. He's going to definitely make it here. And they make him an offer you can't refuse.
在得不到回应的情况下，李小龙决定接受一份在香港的工作。当时香港的功夫电影产业正风靡整个亚洲。他们简直趋之若鹜。他们说：“我们要那个人。我们需要把那个人找来。他已经在好莱坞成功了，他在这里也绝对能成功。”于是他们开出了一个他无法拒绝的条件。

45
00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:34.000
Finally, it's a leading role, a chance to prove his star potential to the executives in the U.S. And it is a hit. It becomes a sensation. It breaks all box office records and becomes a stunt. literally overnight. Immediately afterwards, Bruce shoots another Kung Fu movie, another smash hit called Fist of Fury. And while his star is rising in Hong Kong,
终于，这是一个主角的机会，一个向美国高管证明他票房号召力的机会。电影大获成功。它成了一种轰动现象。它打破了所有票房纪录，一夜之间成为了神话。紧接着，李小龙又拍摄了另一部功夫电影，又一部轰动之作《精武门》。正当他在香港的名气如日中天之际，

