00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:59.000
he finally gets news from Hollywood about his role in the TV show Kung Fu. He gets turned down because they say, we can't understand his accent. And, you know, Bruce has got a British accent. He just has the wrong face. And so they give the part to David Caradine, who tapes up his eyes and darkens his skin and stoops on the set and plays it in yellow face
