47
00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:21.000
and just continues the tradition of how Hollywood looks at Asia. You got to imagine, this is like the role of his life. He really thought he deserved it. He feels like he played the game. He really, you know, worked with these folks and he got to know them. He trained a lot of them in Kung Fu,
这延续了好莱坞看待亚洲的固有传统。你可以想象，这就像是他一生的角色。他真的觉得自己配得上。他觉得自己融入了那个圈子。他真的，你知道的，和这些人共事并了解了他们。他在他们的家里教过他们很多人功夫，

48
00:22:21.000 --> 00:22:46.000
like at their houses. And then they would do this to him and not give him this role and put a white guy into a role playing a Chinese, a half Chinese guy. After that, Bruce has had it with Hollywood. He has had it with America. He decides to stay in Hong Kong for the foreseeable future. He's like, okay, I understand. This is where I have to be. I have to be here in Asia where they can see me.
比如在他们自己的家里。然后他们却这样对待他，不把这个角色给他，反而让一个白人演员去扮演一个中国人和半中国人的混血角色。在那之后，李小龙对好莱坞彻底死心了。他对美国彻底死心了。他决定在可预见的未来留在香港。他心想：好吧，我明白了。这就是我该待的地方。我必须待在这里，待在能看到我的亚洲。

