that he would no longer have to win people over by fighting. Jeff Chang is the author of Water Mirror, Echo, Bruce Lee, and the Making of Asian America. He's also the author of The Classic, Can't Stop, Won't Stop, A History of the Hip-Ont-Stop, A History of the United States and 100 Objects is a production of 99% Invisible and BBC Studios. It's hosted and curated by me, Roman Mars. This episode was produced by Ellie Lightfoot.
